    fix(qa4-new1): brand list reads real analysis status
    
    BrandListView rendered t('status.notAnalyzed') unconditionally
    (BrandListView.vue:249-252) regardless of server state. The badge now
    uses has_completed_analysis (any completed run -> Analyzed, success
    tone) and falls back to analysis_status: running/pending -> Analyzing,
    failed -> Analysis failed, else Not analyzed. Both fields optional so
    old payloads behave as before (brands/types.ts:14-24).

